msgid "Chassis_F18_Bat_Chatillon25t_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Foudre"

msgid "F18_Bat_Chatillon25t_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Foudre"

msgid "F18_Bat_Chatillon25t_hound_TLXXL_descr"
msgstr ""
"This Foudre’s been through hell and came back turbocharged. That power core "
"inside? Still kicking like a mad horse. And with that plasma charger "
"humming, I’m ready to fry every last one of Krieger’s toys. Feels like we’ve"
" fought this battle a dozen times already—same ambush, same terrain, same "
"smug enemy. Time’s bending in knots, but I’m not here to watch the clock. "
"I’m here to burn rubber and leave shell-shaped reminders on everything that "
"moves. This tank’s hot, fast, and angry—and I’m just getting started. Let’s "
"break this loop."

